<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Donnelley cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Rudolf Hokanson downgraded R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- noted that company sees 1996 earnings estimate at $1.45-$1.55; analyst said Wall Street expectations were around $1.70-$1.80, and said it is possible that estimate for next year will be reduced.</p>
<p>-- sees downside risk for stock at $30, &quot;but will linger until performance is proven.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/4 to 31-1/2.</p>
</text>
